    "reading-passage": {
      "nodeId": "544:833",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "📖 Reading Passage",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "📖 Reading Passage"
        },
        {
          "text": "Level: B1 · Topic: The Restaurant",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Level: B1 · Topic: The Restaurant"
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinner at the New Restaurant\n\nLast Friday, my family went to a new restaurant that opened near our house. We had a reservation for seven o'clock, so we arrived a few minutes early.\n\nThe hostess greeted us at the entrance and showed us to our table. It was a corner table with a nice view of the garden. The waiter brought us the menu and a jug of water.\n\nThe menu had several sections: starters, main courses, side dishes, and desserts. My father ordered a bowl of soup as a starter. My mother chose a Caesar salad. I decided to have grilled chicken with roasted potatoes and vegetables as my main course. My brother ordered a cheeseburger with chips.\n\nWhile we waited, the waiter brought a basket of warm bread with olive oil and butter. The food arrived after about twenty minutes. Everything was served on large white plates, and the presentation was beautiful.\n\nThe portions were generous, and the food was delicious. My father said the soup was the best he had ever tasted. After the main course, we looked at the dessert menu. I ordered chocolate mousse, and my mother had a slice of cheesecake.\n\nAt the end of the meal, the waiter brought the bill. My father paid by card and left a tip. The total was reasonable for the quality of the food.\n\nWe all agreed it was a wonderful evening. We will definitely go back.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Dinner at the New Restaurant Last Friday, my family went to a new restaurant that opened near our house. We had a reservation for seven o'clock, so we arrived a few minutes early. The hostess greeted us at the entrance and showed us to our table. It was a corner table with a nice view of the garden. The waiter brought us the menu and a jug of water. The menu had several sections: starters, main courses, side dishes, and desserts. My father ordered a bowl of soup as a starter. My mother chose a Caesar salad. I decided to have grilled chicken with roasted potatoes and vegetables as my main course. My brother ordered a cheeseburger with chips. While we waited, the waiter brought a basket of warm bread with olive oil and butter. The food arrived after about twenty minutes. Everything was served on large white plates, and the presentation was beautiful. The portions were generous, and the food was delicious. My father said the soup was the best he had ever tasted. After the main course, we looked at the dessert menu. I ordered chocolate mousse, and my mother had a slice of cheesecake. At the end of the meal, the waiter brought the bill. My father paid by card and left a tip. The total was reasonable for the quality of the food. We all agreed it was a wonderful evening. We will definitely go back."
        },
        {
          "text": "Comprehension Questions",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Comprehension Questions"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. What time was the family's reservation?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "1. What time was the family's reservation?"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. What did the hostess do when they arrived?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "2. What did the hostess do when they arrived?"
        },
        {
          "text": "3. What did the writer order as a main course?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "3. What did the writer order as a main course?"
        },
        {
          "text": "4. What came while they waited for the food?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "4. What came while they waited for the food?"
        },
        {
          "text": "5. How did the father pay for the meal?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "5. How did the father pay for the meal?"
        }
      ]
    },
    "idioms-phrases": {
      "nodeId": "544:846",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "💬 Idioms, Phrasal Verbs & Key Phrases",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "💬 Idioms, Phrasal Verbs & Key Phrases"
        },
        {
          "text": "eat out",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "eat out"
        },
        {
          "text": "eat at a restaurant instead of at home",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "eat at a restaurant instead of at home"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"We eat out every Friday night.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"We eat out every Friday night.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "pick up the bill / tab",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "pick up the bill / tab"
        },
        {
          "text": "pay for everyone's meal",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "pay for everyone's meal"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Don't worry — I'll pick up the bill tonight.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"Don't worry — I'll pick up the bill tonight.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "on the house",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "on the house"
        },
        {
          "text": "free, paid for by the restaurant",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "free, paid for by the restaurant"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"The dessert is on the house — happy birthday!\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"The dessert is on the house — happy birthday!\""
        },
        {
